<title>SWEDEN: Swedbank 9 mo profit pre losses up.</title>
<headline>Swedbank 9 mo profit pre losses up.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Swedbank on Wednesday said its profit before credit losses rose over four percent for the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank posted a profit before credit losses of 5.12 billion crowns ($774 million) compared to 4.90 billion in the corresponding period a year ago.</p>
<p>Credit losses for the nine months were reported at 1.31 billion crowns versus 1.80 billion crowns a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017 ($ = 6.615 Swedish Crowns)</p>
